+ *                     \/            \/     \/    \/            \/
+ *
+ * Bluetooth audio out (A2DP source + AVRCP remote buttons).
+ *
+ * Every call returns at once; a control thread does the work and the state
+ * changes later. Poll bt_get_status (its gen bumps on every visible change).
